    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thank you for coming back. I've got your notes. How have things been since your last visit?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:14",
      "end_timestamp": "00:22",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Oh, the same. Mostly. Names, sometimes. And where I've put things. I found my glasses in the fridge.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:24",
      "end_timestamp": "00:34",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "When did you first notice the forgetfulness?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:36",
      "end_timestamp": "00:40",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Er, two years ago? Or three. I can't be sure. The wife would know.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:41",
      "end_timestamp": "00:50",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
